---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import site from '../site.config.ts';
import { url } from '../lib/url.ts';
---
<Page title="About" description={`About ${site.name}, a free cash drawer calculator for shop and cafe staff.`}>
  <p>{site.name} is a free tool that counts a cash register drawer at the end of a shift. You enter how many bills, coins and rolls you have. It shows the total, the cash to deposit, and which bills to take out so the float stays in the drawer.</p>
  <h2>Who it is for</h2>
  <p>Cashiers, shift leads, and owners of small shops, cafes and food trucks in the United States. It works on a phone at the register or on a computer in the back office.</p>
  <h2>How to use it</h2>
  <p>Enter your counts with big buttons and a number keypad. The answer updates as you type, with no submit button.</p>
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>All math runs in your browser in whole cents, so there are no rounding errors. Your counts are not sent anywhere. We do not ask you to create an account. The tool saves your last float and your current counts on your own device, so a refresh does not lose them.</p>
  <h2>Who made this</h2>
  <p>This tool was built by <a href="https://bingemind.com/abhishek-mishra/">Abhishek Mishra</a>, a software development engineer (SDE) at Oqu AI, and is published by Bingemind.</p>
  <p>Phone and WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+916376068337">+91 63760 68337</a> (<a href="https://wa.me/916376068337" rel="noopener">message on WhatsApp</a>).</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions or ideas? Write to <a href={site.contactHref}>{site.contactLabel}</a> or visit the <a href={url('/contact/')}>Contact page</a>.</p>
</Page>
